<view class="container profile-page">
  <view class="profile-hero">
    <view class="profile-avatar">
      <text>{{savedMoodEmoji || moodEmoji || '♡'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="profile-hero-copy">
      <view class="profile-eyebrow">热念 · 我们</view>
      <view class="profile-title">我们的两人空间</view>
      <view class="profile-sub" wx:if="{{bindingStatus === 'active'}}">
        心情更新后，TA 打开「我们」就能看到。
      </view>
      <view class="profile-sub" wx:else>
        绑定后，你们可以互相看到彼此现在的心情。
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view
    class="bind-card"
    wx:if="{{!authLoading && bindingStatus !== 'active'}}"
    bindtap="goBind"
  >
    <view class="bind-card-icon">💕</view>
    <view class="bind-card-body">
      <view class="bind-card-title">
        {{bindingStatus === 'waiting' ? '等待 TA 加入' : '先完成双人绑定'}}
      </view>
      <view class="bind-card-sub">
        完成绑定后，就能更新心情并查看 TA 的状态。
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="bind-card-arrow">›</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button bindtap="loadProfile">重新加载</button></view>
  <view class="our-links" wx:if="{{bindingStatus === 'active'}}">
    <view class="our-link agreements-link" bindtap="goAgreements"><view>共同约定</view><text>{{pendingAgreementCount ? pendingAgreementCount + ' 份提议等你回应' : '一起商量的小安排'}}</text><text class="our-link-icon">♡</text></view>
    <view class="our-link coupons-link" bindtap="goCoupons"><view>心意券</view><text>{{pendingCouponCount ? pendingCouponCount + ' 份申请等你确认' : '给彼此一点小偏爱'}}</text><text class="our-link-icon">✉</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="card mood-editor" wx:if="{{bindingStatus === 'active'}}">
    <view class="card-title">我的心情</view>

    <view class="saved-mood" wx:if="{{savedMoodEmoji || savedMoodText}}">
      <view class="saved-mood-emoji">{{savedMoodEmoji || '💭'}}</view>
      <view class="saved-mood-body">
        <view class="saved-mood-text">{{savedMoodText || '只想用一个表情表达现在。'}}</view>
        <view class="saved-mood-time" wx:if="{{myUpdatedLabel}}">更新于 {{myUpdatedLabel}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="mood-label">选一个最接近现在的状态</view>
    <view class="mood-grid">
      <view
        class="mood-chip {{moodEmoji === item.emoji ? 'mood-chip-active' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{moods}}"
        wx:key="emoji"
        data-emoji="{{item.emoji}}"
        bindtap="chooseMood"
      >
        <view class="mood-chip-emoji">{{item.emoji}}</view>
        <view class="mood-chip-label">{{item.label}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="mood-label mood-text-label">再写一句给 TA 看</view>
    <textarea
      class="mood-input"
      value="{{moodText}}"
      placeholder="例如：今天有点累，想要一个抱抱。"
      maxlength="60"
      auto-height
      bindinput="onMoodTextInput"
    />
    <view class="mood-count">{{moodText.length}}/60</view>

    <button
      class="mood-save-btn"
      bindtap="saveMood"
      disabled="{{saving || authLoading || (!moodEmoji && !moodText)}}"
    >
      更新我的心情
    </button>
  </view>


  <view class="card reminder-card" wx:if="{{bindingStatus === 'active'}}">
    <view class="reminder-head">
      <view>
        <view class="card-title">每日分享提醒</view>
        <view class="reminder-sub">到点仍未分享时，微信会发一条服务通知。</view>
      </view>
      <switch
        color="#ff6b81"
        checked="{{reminderEnabled}}"
        disabled="{{reminderSaving || authLoading || !reminderReady}}"
        bindchange="onReminderToggle"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="reminder-row">
      <view class="reminder-row-copy">
        <view class="reminder-row-title">提醒时间</view>
        <view class="reminder-row-sub">仅在当天还没有分享时提醒</view>
      </view>
      <picker
        mode="selector"
        range="{{reminderTimeOptions}}"
        value="{{reminderTimeIndex}}"
        disabled="{{reminderSaving || authLoading || !reminderReady}}"
        bindchange="onReminderTimeChange"
      >
        <view class="reminder-time">{{reminderTime}} ›</view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="reminder-status {{reminderEnabled ? 'on' : ''}}">
      <text class="reminder-dot"></text>
      <text>{{reminderStatusText}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="reminder-note">
      此模板是一次性订阅：每成功发送 1 次提醒后，需要再次点击开启，微信才会允许下一次提醒。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="partner-section" wx:if="{{bindingStatus === 'active'}}">
    <view class="section-heading">
      <view>
        <view class="section-title">TA 现在的心情</view>
        <view class="section-sub">这里只显示 TA 主动分享给你的状态</view>
      </view>
      <view class="section-heart">♡</view>
    </view>

    <view class="partner-mood-card" wx:if="{{partner.hasMood}}">
      <view class="partner-mood-emoji">{{partner.moodEmoji || '💭'}}</view>
      <view class="partner-mood-body">
        <view class="partner-mood-text">
          {{partner.moodText || 'TA 只留了一个表情。'}}
        </view>
        <view class="partner-mood-time" wx:if="{{partner.moodUpdatedLabel}}">
          {{partner.moodUpdatedLabel}}
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="partner-empty" wx:else>
      <view class="partner-empty-icon">☁️</view>
      <view class="partner-empty-title">TA 还没有更新心情</view>
      <view class="partner-empty-sub">等 TA 想说的时候再看看吧。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="profile-footnote" wx:if="{{bindingStatus === 'active'}}">
    心情只是当下的一次表达，不替代真正的沟通。看到 TA 状态不太好时，可以主动问一句“怎么啦？”
  </view>
</view>
